  "contentHtml": "<p>렌즈 수업 준비하면서 이리저리 검색해보니 어안렌즈로 재밌게 노는 장면을 발견하고 저도 어플 설치해봤습니다.</p><p>이걸로 스마트폰과 교실 티브이 미러링해서 일단 제얼굴 망가뜨려 보고(화면전환하면 셀카 가능), 원하는 학생의 얼굴도 비춰줘볼까합니다.^^</p><p>요런 식으로 ㅋㅋ <a href=\"https://youtu.be/MBQCUG5-C2s\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://youtu.be/MBQCUG5-C2s</a></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c8a6a187fcf0ab9e87d79ce80ad5056565ae950d\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"311\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c8a6a187fcf0ab9e87d79ce80ad5056565ae950d\" data-origin-width=\"1028\" data-origin-height=\"981\"><div class=\"figcaption\">어안렌즈 어플(플레이스토어)</div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/253ec3b9eb305da6e356c29054501c75685fdd44\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"301\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/253ec3b9eb305da6e356c29054501c75685fdd44\" data-origin-width=\"729\" data-origin-height=\"1440\"><div class=\"figcaption\">어안렌즈 실행 모습(체크를 클릭하면 렌즈 전환 가능)</div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c873b1ab6f75f10a944018e64ffb7a04932aed49\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"245\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c873b1ab6f75f10a944018e64ffb7a04932aed49\" data-origin-width=\"665\" data-origin-height=\"1440\"><div class=\"figcaption\">볼록렌즈의 곡률 조정 가능</div></div><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b79a6690fbdb009b834b9bb8f2b7f52460a4e39c\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"261\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b79a6690fbdb009b834b9bb8f2b7f52460a4e39c\" data